{
  "Enemies.GooArmor.Desc": "Before you stands a suit of plated mail armor filled with a bright blue goo, standing perhaps six feet off the ground. She has a beautiful, feminine face, and her scowl as she stands before you is almost cute. She has formed a mighty greatsword from her goo, and has assumed the stance of a well-trained warrior."
  "Enemies.GooArmor.Name": "Goo Armor"
}
